    "engine": "jupyter",
    "markdown": "---\ngd-head-tags:\n  - >-\n    `<script type=\"application/ld+json\">[{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"SoftwareSourceCode\", \"name\": \"EdgeCase\", \"description\":\n    \"High-performance graph analysis library\", \"codeRepository\":\n    \"https://github.com/rich-iannone/edgecase\", \"license\":\n    \"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT\", \"url\":\n    \"https://rich-iannone.github.io/edgecase\", \"documentation\":\n    \"https://rich-iannone.github.io/edgecase\", \"programmingLanguage\": {\"@type\":\n    \"ComputerLanguage\", \"name\": \"Python\"}}, {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"name\": \"Graph.is_attracting_component - EdgeCase\",\n    \"isPartOf\": {\"@type\": \"WebSite\", \"name\": \"EdgeCase\"}, \"url\":\n    \"https://rich-iannone.github.io/edgecase/reference/Graph.is_attracting_component.html\"}]</script>`{=html}\nopen-graph:\n  title: >-\n    [Graph.is_attracting_component()]{.doc-object-name .doc-function .doc-label\n    .doc-label-method} | EdgeCase\n  description: Check if a directed graph is a single attracting component.\ntwitter-card:\n  title: >-\n    [Graph.is_attracting_component()]{.doc-object-name .doc-function .doc-label\n    .doc-label-method} | EdgeCase\n  description: Check if a directed graph is a single attracting component.\ntitle: >-\n  [Graph.is_attracting_component()]{.doc-object-name .doc-function .doc-label\n  .doc-label-method}\nbody-classes: doc-api-page doc-py-api-page\nshift-heading-level-by: 0\nbread-crumbs: false\ntoc-depth: 3\ndescription-meta: Check if a directed graph is a single attracting component.\npage-navigation: false\nhtml-table-processing: none\n---\n\n::: {.doc-subject}\n\nCheck if a directed graph is a single attracting component.\n:::\n\n::: {.doc-usage-source}\nUsage\n\n[Source](https://github.com/rich-iannone/edgecase/blob/main/python/edgecase/graph.py#L75278-L75350){target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"}\n:::\n\n::: {.doc-signature .doc-function}\n```pythonsignature\nGraph.is_attracting_component()\n```\n:::\n\n::: {.doc-text}\n\n![Is attracting component](../assets/graphs/is-attracting-component.light.svg){.lightbox fig-alt=\"Left: a directed cycle A to B to C to A; a walk can go anywhere and never leave, so the whole graph is one attracting component and is_attracting_component() returns True. Right: the same triangle with the edge between C and A reversed to point from A to C (shown in the accent color); walks now end at C, the only attracting component, which leaves out A and B, so is_attracting_component() returns False.\" width=\"100%\"}\n\nTrue when the whole graph is one attracting component: strongly connected, so a walk can\nget from anywhere to anywhere and never leave. For a Markov chain this is\nirreducibility.\n:::\n\n## Returns {.doc-returns}\n\n::: {.doc-definition-items}\n<code> [bool]{.doc-parameter-annotation}</code>\n\n:   `True` if the graph has exactly one attracting component and it contains every node.\n:::\n\n## Raises {.doc-raises}\n\n::: {.doc-definition-items}\n<code> [ValueError]{.doc-parameter-annotation}</code>\n\n:   If the graph is undirected.\n:::\n\n## Technical Notes {.doc-technical-notes}\n\nUses `attracting_components()`; matches NetworkX's `is_attracting_component`.\n\n## See Also {.doc-see-also}\n\n[](`~attracting_components`) \n\n:   The attracting components of any directed graph.\n\n[](`~is_strongly_connected`) \n\n:   The same check, which also works on undirected graphs.\n\n## Examples {.doc-examples}\n\nA directed cycle is one attracting component, since a walk can go anywhere and never\nleave. With a tail off the cycle it isn't, since a walk that leaves the cycle can't\nreturn:\n\n::: {#d15f26ed .cell execution_count=1}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\nimport edgecase as ec\n\ncycle = [(\"A\", \"B\"), (\"B\", \"C\"), (\"C\", \"A\")]\nring = ec.Graph.from_edges(cycle, directed=True)\ntailed = ec.Graph.from_edges(cycle + [(\"C\", \"D\")], directed=True)\n\nring.is_attracting_component(), tailed.is_attracting_component()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=1}\n```\n(True, False)\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Never stuck with a currency\n\n`currency()` holds the exchange rates quoted between six currencies, each edge directed\nfrom the currency sold to the currency bought. Every currency can be changed into every\nother, so a trader can never get stuck holding one. If the desk stopped buying back\nCanadian dollars, it would be: the only quote out of Canadian dollars is into US dollars,\nso Canadian dollars would become an attracting component on their own:\n\n::: {#b0bbe7c4 .cell execution_count=2}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\nfx = ec.currency()\nbefore = fx.is_attracting_component()\n\nfx.delete_edge(\"CAD\", \"USD\")\nstuck = fx.attracting_components()\n\nlabel = fx.get_label_from_id\nbefore, fx.is_attracting_component(), [label(n) for c in stuck for n in c]\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=2}\n```\n(True, False, ['CAD'])\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n::: {#fdf49a2e .cell execution_count=3}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\nfx.plot(\n    highlight=[\"USD\", \"CAD\"], label_by=\"label\", curved_edges=True, seed=4\n)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=3}\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"ec-theme\" style=\"display:contents\"><style class=\"ec-theme-vars\">:where(.ec-theme){--ect-3239c383:#fafafa;--ect-e5dfd507:#94a3b8;--ect-8a2de1d4:#374151;--ect-57425a7e:rgba(15,23,42,0.88);--ect-21ade003:#f1f5f9;--ect-61169ea5:#c2410c;--ect-63cc1385:#d4d4d8;--ect-879b7ebc:#949497;--ect-b9f8de6d:#872d08;--ect-f59ba8df:#a1a1aa}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){.ec-theme{--ect-3239c383:#0d1117;--ect-e5dfd507:#4b5563;--ect-8a2de1d4:#d1d5db;--ect-57425a7e:rgba(241,245,249,0.92);--ect-21ade003:#0f172a;--ect-61169ea5:#f97316;--ect-63cc1385:#3f3f46;--ect-879b7ebc:#2c2c31;--ect-b9f8de6d:#ae500f;--ect-f59ba8df:#71717a}}:is(html.quarto-light, body.quarto-light, html[data-bs-theme=\"light\"], [data-jp-theme-light=\"true\"], body.vscode-light, body.vscode-high-contrast-light, html[theme=\"light\"]) .ec-theme{--ect-3239c383:#fafafa;--ect-e5dfd507:#94a3b8;--ect-8a2de1d4:#374151;--ect-57425a7e:rgba(15,23,42,0.88);--ect-21ade003:#f1f5f9;--ect-61169ea5:#c2410c;--ect-63cc1385:#d4d4d8;--ect-879b7ebc:#949497;--ect-b9f8de6d:#872d08;--ect-f59ba8df:#a1a1aa}:is(html.quarto-dark, body.quarto-dark, html[data-bs-theme=\"dark\"], [data-jp-theme-light=\"false\"], body.vscode-dark, body.vscode-high-contrast:not(.vscode-high-contrast-light), html[theme=\"dark\"]) .ec-theme{--ect-3239c383:#0d1117;--ect-e5dfd507:#4b5563;--ect-8a2de1d4:#d1d5db;--ect-57425a7e:rgba(241,245,249,0.92);--ect-21ade003:#0f172a;--ect-61169ea5:#f97316;--ect-63cc1385:#3f3f46;--ect-879b7ebc:#2c2c31;--ect-b9f8de6d:#ae500f;--ect-f59ba8df:#71717a}</style><div class=\"ec-plot\" style=\"position:relative;width:fit-content;max-width:100%;margin:1em auto\">\n<style>.ec-plot > svg { display:block; max-width:100%; height:auto; }</style>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"700\" height=\"500\" viewBox=\"14.0 20.0 672.0 480.0\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<rect x=\"14.0\" y=\"20.0\" width=\"672.0\" height=\"480.0\" fill=\"var(--ect-3239c383)\"/>\n<g opacity=\"0.2\"><path id=\"path-3-1-0\" d=\"M 340.4 422.9 Q 439.4 352.7 424.0 232.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ect-e5dfd507)\" stroke-width=\"2.64\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"424.0,232.4 431.7,249.1 420.8,250.5\" fill=\"var(--ect-e5dfd507)\"/></g>\n<path d=\"M 340.4 422.9 Q 439.4 352.7 424.0 232.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"transparent\" stroke-width=\"8.0\" pointer-events=\"stroke\" data-edge=\"3-1-0\" data-attrs='{\"id\": 4, \"edge\": \"GBP \\u2192 USD\", \"weight\": -0.238, \"rate\": 1.269, \"neg_log_rate\": -0.238}'/>\n<g opacity=\"0.2\"><path id=\"path-3-2-1\" d=\"M 343.3 433.0 Q 460.3 438.9 520.5 338.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ect-